  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 4,
      "zh": "今天想讲一个概念：业力、愿力和努力",
      "en": "Karma, will, and effort."
    },
    {
      "start": 4,
      "end": 11,
      "zh": "我看到一篇小红书文章，它用了一个很好的 analogy",
      "en": "A simple analogy made the idea click."
    },
    {
      "start": 11,
      "end": 16,
      "zh": "努力，就像你不停地用船桨去划船",
      "en": "Effort is rowing harder."
    },
    {
      "start": 16,
      "end": 23,
      "zh": "业力，就是船下面水流的方向",
      "en": "Karma is the current under the boat."
    },
    {
      "start": 23,
      "end": 28,
      "zh": "如果水流和你相反，其实怎么划都没有用",
      "en": "If the current runs against you, effort leaks away."
    },
    {
      "start": 28,
      "end": 34,
      "zh": "业力通常由我们的习惯构成，也就是所谓的命",
      "en": "Karma is built from habit. What we call fate."
    },
    {
      "start": 34,
      "end": 42,
      "zh": "命本身会推动你，影响你往哪里走",
      "en": "It keeps pushing the direction you drift."
    },
    {
      "start": 42,
      "end": 49,
      "zh": "后来我又看到：努力、业力和愿力",
      "en": "Then comes the third force: will."
    },
    {
      "start": 49,
      "end": 57,
      "zh": "愿力是最高级的，它相当于是风",
      "en": "Will is the wind above the water."
    },
    {
      "start": 57,
      "end": 63.3,
      "zh": "如果你有极强的愿力，你是能够逆天改命的",
      "en": "Strong will can change the current."
    }
  ],
